    <section class="solutionS">
      <div class="bg-spot">
        <img src="./images/bg-spot.png" />
      </div>
      <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="row mb-100px">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
              <h3 class="mb-50px mt-0 text-white">SOLUTIONS</h3>
              <p class="mb-0 text-white">
                Oasis Pro has built out a suite of supportive offerings to
                serve client growth as the digital securities markets evolve,
                bringing greater efficiency, transparency and liquidity to the
                capital markets.<sup>1</sup>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-100px">
              <div class="box-content">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="mt-0 mb-50px">Transact</h3>
                  <p class="mb-50px">
                    Oasis Pro Markets operates our multi-asset alternative
                    trading system (ATS) for the primary issuance and
                    secondary trading of public and private digital
                    securities.<sup>1</sup> Using our ATS, issuers and
                    subscribers can securely transact in a range of assets,
                    making payment via fiat or digital currencies.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <a href="https://www.oasispromarkets.com/" class="btn-outline-main">LEARN MORE</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-100px">
              <div class="box-content">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="mt-0 mb-50px">Digitize</h3>
                  <p class="mb-50px">
                    Oasis Pro Tokenization enables issuers to convert
                    real-world assets into digital representations of the
                    same. Built on modular architecture, the platform supports
                    all tokenization features through UI and APIs and provides
                    the ability to add support for more tokenization standards
                    and blockchains, with a factory pattern for deploying new
                    token contracts.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <a href="https://oasisprosto.com/" class="btn-outline-main">LEARN MORE</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-100px">
              <div class="box-content">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="mt-0 mb-50px">Manage</h3>
                  <p class="mb-50px">
                    Partners can maintain on-chain and off-chain cap tables
                    and real time reporting capabilities by integrating with
                    Oasis Pro Transfer Agent. This platform supports multiple
                    blockchains, improves transparency due to on-chain
                    management, reduces manual intervention, and allows for
                    interoperability between permissioned blockchains. It can
                    be fully integrated with Oasis Pro Markets.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <a href="https://www.oasisprota.com/" class="btn-outline-main mt-auto">LEARN MORE</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 mb-100px">
              <div class="box-content">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="mt-0 mb-50px">Connect</h3>
                  <p class="mb-50px">
                    Through Oasis Pro API Connect, a customizable suite of
                    APIs empowers partners to deliver digital securities
                    solutions, both for primary issuances and secondary
                    trading, via our ecosystem, with their branded apps
                    connected to our modern, flexible APIs.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <a href="https://oasisproconnect.com/" class="btn-outline-main mt-auto">LEARN MORE</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="box-content">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="mt-0 mb-50px">Interoperability</h3>
                  <p class="mb-50px">
                    Through Oasis Pro Levant, a messaging protocol offers a robust solution for enhancing
                    interoperability and allowing for seamless message passing between diverse blockchain networks. At
                    the core of our interoperability platform is the fundamental objective of advancing cross-chain
                    functionality, a pivotal element for the widespread adoption and enhanced utility of blockchain
                    technology.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <a href="https://oasislevant.com/" class="btn-outline-main mt-auto">LEARN MORE</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div> -->
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
